      </td>
     <td><para unique="1045908">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1045910">FMA</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1045912">Multiply packed single precision floating-point values from xmm1 and xmm3/mem, add to xmm2 and put result in xmm1.</para>
      </td>
